i><li><p>Get our <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl">breaking news email</a>, <a href="https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3">free app</a> or <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Alpine ski resorts in New South Wales and Victoria saw climate records shattered at the weekend with maximum temperatures up to 12C above average.</p><p>Ski areas of Mount Hotham and Falls Creek set July records for their hottest daytime and night-time temperatures and Thredbo also set a new hottest July day, according to the Bureau of Meteorology.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/21/australian-ski-resorts-smash-july-climate-records-with-temperatures-12c-above-average">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;GetB6LDamF3jAaFR6x-c2FOG3PRoIkQ9pmoxNbgpHMMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;eSyJW5NYCZNRowFLthyLFPdDWOvMuA3CUUNQ1gL2pDUƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;VKnBqKmUPOcnmWOOVqP2Xd8Vkc2rQnAurEJqGbiz4lcƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;McXtqI2Ux23blvuutUAuU28vp-Id2hPi5TUIZ6YMur4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;QymqwCZVGA4ETrSUt9311qpVvMQJ6d34s8-s7lcxCrMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ySDjnmlHxjMILXE5TuxEG7AfFR3MsaNGHOLGZ_kEh4Mƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;DhAh0g9kwwmkS_UX9F5_Tf7cIIfHeWuk7LSSQE23VZEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerig