orts in New South Wales and Victoria saw climate records shattered at the weekend with maximum temperatures up to 12C above average.</p><p>Ski areas of Mount Hotham and Falls Creek set July records for their hottest daytime and night-time temperatures and Thredbo also set a new hottest July day, according to the Bureau of Meteorology.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/21/australian-ski-resorts-smash-july-climate-records-with-temperatures-12c-above-average">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;H2lwavcGgH91dju2Sj5l4Hl1__TYHSQXb-WTRfjsheYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxUAustralian ski resorts smash July climate records with temperatures 12C above averageƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;HBV4SMVYgDb8Hq6sXlM8f8VpjOtobaV1UB0rPFPtuzUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ncbIKhjxuSx9eVicQbKJfOsTThFKriNOW-DXSyxRN5Qƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxŒhttps://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/jul/21/australian-ski-resorts-smash-july-climate-records-with-temperatures-12c-above-averageƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;PqAb04FaaNmeK9z4flCqQIOB7EdRAj_3KSutge8mQT4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxUaustralian-ski-resorts-smash-july-climate-records-with-temperatures-12c-above-averageƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;kqDdjwjK6yBwiL7xfigZ8wBHoyET0hR3SBLO4I4x3eEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwSyndicationSourceBundleƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;066hzqgz4VyMVeE1toihq3gSyOMp3b-aJTgTGNBW-SMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒer